If you wish to build Minos for yourself normally this will be for Linux), 

Clone the repository

    cd ~
    git clone git://git.code.sf.net/p/minos/minos Minos2

Switch to the latest release branch (currently 4.6)

    cd Minos2
    git checkout Mqt_Release_2.6.0.0

And follow the instructions in the relevant "Building Minos - <OS>.txt"

    Building Minos - Linux.txt
